<title>USA: Ameriana to buyback up to 300,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Ameriana to buyback up to 300,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW CASTLE, Ind. 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ameriana Bancorp said Thursday its board approved the repurchase of up to 300,000 of the 3.3 million shares of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it has authorized the spending of up to $5 million for the repurchase program, which will expire June 1998.</p>
<p>The company said the purchases will depend on market conditions. Share repurchases generally would be effected through the open market, although unsolicited negotiated transactions may occur.</p>
<p>The company bought 127,966 shares under its previous buyback program, which expires this month.</p>
</text>
